# scripts/opcount: `kvbench bench fileput N` makes N puts into a std
# kv/file store over 64 keys, each an append of one line to a log in
# $TMPDIR (ST3); the cost of one put is the slope between the two sizes.
# The control is hand Go with a log held open and a map under a mutex; the
# floor writes each line from a reused buffer to a log held open.
unit put
sizes 20000 120000
args bench fileput {n}
control benchmarks/kv/testdata/control
floor benchmarks/kv/testdata/floor
